sequenceDiagram
    participant App as 应用程序
    participant Wrapper as 平台 Wrapper<br/>(Android/iOS/Flutter)
    participant Core as SDK Core (Go)
    participant Device as 设备信息
    participant Store as 加密存储
    participant DNS as DNS 预热

    App->>Wrapper: 1. 构建 Config 对象
    App->>Wrapper: 2. 调用 initialize(config)

    activate Wrapper
    Wrapper->>Core: 3. 序列化 JSON → FFI 调用

    activate Core
    Core->>Core: 4. 解析 AccessKey<br/>(提取 TenantUUID, DeploymentUUID)

    Core->>Device: 5. 采集设备信息
    Device-->>Core: DeviceUUID, 系统信息

    Core->>Store: 6. 初始化加密存储
    Store-->>Core: 存储就绪

    Core->>Core: 7. 初始化日志系统
    Core->>Core: 8. 启动本地代理服务
    Core->>Core: 9. 初始化负载均衡

    Core->>DNS: 10. DNS 预热 (pre_resolve_hosts)
    activate DNS
    Note over DNS: 后台异步预解析

    Core-->>Wrapper: 返回 0 (成功)
    deactivate Core

    Wrapper-->>App: 返回结果码
    deactivate Wrapper

    DNS-->>Core: 预解析完成
    deactivate DNS

    Note over App: 初始化完成，可调用代理 API
